{
  "_comment": "Provider adapters for the floor-plan benchmark. Every paid adapter is disabled. Enabling one needs ALL of: an approved run manifest (runs/approved-run.json, see README), the --paid flag, FLH_FPA_PAID_RUN set to that manifest's runId, the provider key in the environment, and enabled:true here for that provider. Model ids marked unverified must be confirmed against the provider's model list before a run.",
